1	/**
2	 * T4 — Integration tests covering the full QA checklist items that are not
3	 * already addressed by unit tests in other files.
4	 *
5	 * Covered here:
6	 *   - Default filter initialises from storage when present (full round-trip)
7	 *   - Filter defaults to all-except-done on first visit (null storage)
8	 *   - Manual sync calls both board-data and PR-task-data reload functions
9	 *   - Auto-refresh ref pattern keeps interval stable across reload-function changes
10	 *   - TaskTrackingPanel calls setSelectedTask with correct shape on task click
11	 */
